WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
SPEAKER 1 (COUNCIL): GOOD EVENING AND WELCOME TO THE MARCH 12 MEETING OF THE BIRCH CITY COUNCIL.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
SPEAKER 2 (COUNCIL): ITEM 9.B IS THE OAK STREET SIDEWALK REPAIR CONTRACT.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.000
SPEAKER 3 (COUNCIL): I CANNOT SUPPORT THE GRANITE WORKS CONTRACT AT THIS PRICE.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
SPEAKER 1 (COUNCIL): THE MOTION PASSES FOUR TO ONE.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
SPEAKER 1 (COUNCIL): WE ARE ADJOURNED.
